<tbxHeader><fileDesc><sourceDesc><p>Diffusion Works — Injection Molding &amp; Plastics Processing Termbase — evaluation sample (50 terms). Non-commercial evaluation use only.</p></sourceDesc></fileDesc></tbxHeader>
<text><body>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-00166"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / polymers-materials</descrip><descrip type="definition">Mass of thermoplastic melt extruded through a standard die in a plastometer at a specified temperature and load, stated in g/10 min and used as a simple measure of flowability.</descrip><admin type="source">ISO 1133-1 Plastics — Determination of the melt mass-flow rate (MFR) and melt volume-flow rate (MVR) of thermoplastics — Part 1: Standard method; ASTM D1238 Standard Test Method for Melt Flow Rates of Thermoplastics by Extrusion Plastometer</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>melt mass-flow rate</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>MFR</term><termNote type="termType">abbreviation</termNote><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>melt flow rate</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>melt flow index</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>MFI</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>melt index</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>MI</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>メルトマスフローレイト</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>MI</term><termNote type="termType">abbreviation</termNote><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>メルトフローレイト</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>メルトフローインデックス</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>メルトインデックス</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>メルトボリュームフローレイト</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「メルトボリュームフローレイト」（日本語）、「熔体体积流动速率」（中国語）、「Schmelze-Volumenfließrate」（ドイツ語）、「índice de fluidez en volumen」（スペイン語）は押し出された体積で表す MVR（cm³/10 min）の名称で、質量で表す MFR（g/10 min）とは別の値。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>熔体质量流动速率</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>熔融指数</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>熔体流动指数</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>熔体体积流动速率</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「メルトボリュームフローレイト」（日本語）、「熔体体积流动速率」（中国語）、「Schmelze-Volumenfließrate」（ドイツ語）、「índice de fluidez en volumen」（スペイン語）は押し出された体積で表す MVR（cm³/10 min）の名称で、質量で表す MFR（g/10 min）とは別の値。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>용융 질량 흐름률</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>용융 지수</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>멜트 인덱스</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Schmelze-Massefließrate</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Schmelzindex</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Schmelze-Volumenfließrate</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「メルトボリュームフローレイト」（日本語）、「熔体体积流动速率」（中国語）、「Schmelze-Volumenfließrate」（ドイツ語）、「índice de fluidez en volumen」（スペイン語）は押し出された体積で表す MVR（cm³/10 min）の名称で、質量で表す MFR（g/10 min）とは別の値。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>índice de fluidez en masa</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>índice de fluidez</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>índice de fluidez en volumen</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「メルトボリュームフローレイト」（日本語）、「熔体体积流动速率」（中国語）、「Schmelze-Volumenfließrate」（ドイツ語）、「índice de fluidez en volumen」（スペイン語）は押し出された体積で表す MVR（cm³/10 min）の名称で、質量で表す MFR（g/10 min）とは別の値。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-00176"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / polymers-materials</descrip><descrip type="definition">Fluid whose viscosity depends on shear rate or shear history; polymer melts are non-Newtonian and their viscosity falls as shear rate rises.</descrip><admin type="source">Dealy &amp; Wissbrun, Melt Rheology and Its Role in Plastics Processing, Springer</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>non-Newtonian fluid</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>non-Newtonian liquid</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>非ニュートン流体</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>非牛顿流体</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>비뉴턴 유체</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>nicht-newtonsches Fluid</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>nichtnewtonsche Flüssigkeit</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>fluido no newtoniano</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-00291"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / polymers-materials</descrip><descrip type="definition">Colorant that dissolves in the polymer and gives transparent coloring, unlike an insoluble pigment; used mainly in amorphous, transparent plastics.</descrip><admin type="source">Charvat (ed.), Coloring of Plastics: Fundamentals and Colorants, 2nd ed., Wiley</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>dye</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>soluble colorant</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>染料</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>顔料</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「顔料」（日本語）・「颜料」（中国語）・「안료」（韓国語）・「Pigment」（ドイツ語）・「pigmento」（スペイン語）は樹脂に溶けない粒子状の着色剤で、樹脂に溶ける染料とは別の概念。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>染料</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>颜料</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「顔料」（日本語）・「颜料」（中国語）・「안료」（韓国語）・「Pigment」（ドイツ語）・「pigmento」（スペイン語）は樹脂に溶けない粒子状の着色剤で、樹脂に溶ける染料とは別の概念。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>염료</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>안료</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「顔料」（日本語）・「颜料」（中国語）・「안료」（韓国語）・「Pigment」（ドイツ語）・「pigmento」（スペイン語）は樹脂に溶けない粒子状の着色剤で、樹脂に溶ける染料とは別の概念。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Farbstoff</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Pigment</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「顔料」（日本語）・「颜料」（中国語）・「안료」（韓国語）・「Pigment」（ドイツ語）・「pigmento」（スペイン語）は樹脂に溶けない粒子状の着色剤で、樹脂に溶ける染料とは別の概念。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>colorante soluble</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>tinte</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>pigmento</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「顔料」（日本語）・「颜料」（中国語）・「안료」（韓国語）・「Pigment」（ドイツ語）・「pigmento」（スペイン語）は樹脂に溶けない粒子状の着色剤で、樹脂に溶ける染料とは別の概念。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-00368"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / injection-unit</descrip><descrip type="definition">Volume or mass of resin that the hopper of an injection molding machine, dryer or loader can hold, stated in its specification.</descrip><admin type="source">Kawata: autoloader VL series product information (public); Johannaber, Injection Molding Machines: A User's Guide, 4th ed. (Hanser, 2008)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>hopper capacity</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>hopper volume</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>ホッパ容量</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ホッパー容量</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>料斗容量</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>호퍼 용량</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Trichtervolumen</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Trichterinhalt</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>capacidad de la tolva</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-00407"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / material-handling</descrip><descrip type="definition">Water content left in plastic pellets after drying, usually stated in percent by mass and compared with the resin supplier's maximum allowable value for molding.</descrip><admin type="source">Polyplastics: technical solutions (POM, PBT, PPS, LCP) public technical pages</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>residual moisture</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>residual moisture content</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>残留水分</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>残存水分</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>残留水分</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>残余水分</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>잔류 수분</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Restfeuchte</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Restfeuchtigkeit</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>humedad residual</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-00513"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / material-handling</descrip><descrip type="definition">Size-reduction machine with knives on a rotor cutting against fixed bed knives above a screen, used to turn sprues, runners and rejected parts into regrind for reuse.</descrip><admin type="source">EN 12012-1 Plastics and rubber machines — Size reduction machines — Part 1: Safety requirements for blade granulators</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>granulator</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>粉砕機</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>グラニュレータ</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>粉碎机</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>破碎机</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>造粒机</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「造粒机」（中国語）は樹脂をペレットにする造粒機（ペレタイザー）を指し、スプルー・ランナーや不良品を砕いて粉砕材にする粉砕機とは別の機械。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>분쇄기</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Schneidmühle</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>granuladora</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>granulador</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-00527"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / material-handling</descrip><descrip type="definition">Molded part sorted out because it fails inspection or process monitoring limits, to be scrapped, reground or reworked.</descrip><admin type="source">Rosato, Rosato &amp; Rosato, Injection Molding Handbook, 3rd ed., Springer; Goodship, Troubleshooting Injection Moulding, Rapra Review Report (Rapra Technology, 2004)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>reject part</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>reject</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>rejected part</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>NG part</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>不良品</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>返品</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「返品」（日本語）、「退货」（中国語）、「반품」（韓国語）は顧客から返された出荷品の意で、工程で選別した不良成形品には使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>不良品</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>次品</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>退货</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「返品」（日本語）、「退货」（中国語）、「반품」（韓国語）は顧客から返された出荷品の意で、工程で選別した不良成形品には使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>불량품</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>반품</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「返品」（日本語）、「退货」（中国語）、「반품」（韓国語）は顧客から返された出荷品の意で、工程で選別した不良成形品には使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Ausschussteil</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Schlechtteil</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>pieza rechazada</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>rechazo</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-00734"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / injection-unit</descrip><descrip type="definition">Hydraulic cylinder on the injection unit whose piston pushes the screw forward to inject the melt and hold pressure on it.</descrip><admin type="source">F. Johannaber, Injection Molding Machines: A User's Guide, 4th ed., Hanser (2008)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>injection cylinder</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>injection ram cylinder</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>射出シリンダ</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>射出用油圧シリンダ</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>加熱シリンダ</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「加熱シリンダ」（日本語）、「料筒」（中国語）、「가열 실린더」（韓国語）、「Plastifizierzylinder」（ドイツ語）は樹脂を溶かすバレルを指し、スクリュを前進させる油圧シリンダとは別の部品。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>注射油缸</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>射胶油缸</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>注射液压缸</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>料筒</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「加熱シリンダ」（日本語）、「料筒」（中国語）、「가열 실린더」（韓国語）、「Plastifizierzylinder」（ドイツ語）は樹脂を溶かすバレルを指し、スクリュを前進させる油圧シリンダとは別の部品。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>사출 실린더</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>사출 유압 실린더</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>가열 실린더</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「加熱シリンダ」（日本語）、「料筒」（中国語）、「가열 실린더」（韓国語）、「Plastifizierzylinder」（ドイツ語）は樹脂を溶かすバレルを指し、スクリュを前進させる油圧シリンダとは別の部品。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Einspritzzylinder</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Spritzzylinder</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Plastifizierzylinder</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「加熱シリンダ」（日本語）、「料筒」（中国語）、「가열 실린더」（韓国語）、「Plastifizierzylinder」（ドイツ語）は樹脂を溶かすバレルを指し、スクリュを前進させる油圧シリンダとは別の部品。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>cilindro hidráulico de inyección</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>cilindro de inyección</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-00745"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / molding-process</descrip><descrip type="definition">Filling the cavity at a very high injection speed, typically for thin-wall parts, using an accumulator-assisted hydraulic or a high-response electric injection unit.</descrip><admin type="source">Osswald, Turng, Gramann (eds.), Injection Molding Handbook, 2nd ed. (Hanser, 2008)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>high-speed injection</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>high-speed filling</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>高速射出</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ハイサイクル成形</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「ハイサイクル成形」（日本語）はサイクルタイムを短くする成形の総称で、射出速度を高くすることを指す語ではない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>高速注射</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>高速注塑</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>고속 사출</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Hochgeschwindigkeitseinspritzung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>schnelles Einspritzen</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>inyección a alta velocidad</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>inyección de alta velocidad</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-00785"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / injection-unit</descrip><descrip type="definition">Set or actual forward speed of the screw during the filling phase, in mm/s, often profiled in stages; it determines the melt flow rate into the cavity.</descrip><admin type="source">ISO 294-1 Plastics — Injection moulding of test specimens of thermoplastic materials — Part 1: General principles</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>injection speed</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>injection velocity</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>射出速度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>噴射速度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「噴射速度」（日本語）、「喷射速度」（中国語）、「분사 속도」（韓国語）は燃料噴射や噴霧の速度を指す語で、射出成形のスクリュ前進速度には使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>注射速度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>注塑速度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>喷射速度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「噴射速度」（日本語）、「喷射速度」（中国語）、「분사 속도」（韓国語）は燃料噴射や噴霧の速度を指す語で、射出成形のスクリュ前進速度には使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>사출 속도</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>분사 속도</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「噴射速度」（日本語）、「喷射速度」（中国語）、「분사 속도」（韓国語）は燃料噴射や噴霧の速度を指す語で、射出成形のスクリュ前進速度には使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Einspritzgeschwindigkeit</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>velocidad de inyección</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-00892"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / clamping-unit</descrip><descrip type="definition">Force with which the clamping unit holds the mold halves closed against the opening force of the cavity pressure; the rated maximum is used to size the machine.</descrip><admin type="source">ISO 472 Plastics — Vocabulary; GB/T 25156 Rubber and plastics injection moulding machines — General technical conditions; F. Johannaber, Injection Molding Machines: A User's Guide, 4th ed., Hanser (2008); D. M. Bryce, Plastic Injection Molding: Manufacturing Process Fundamentals, SME (1996)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>clamping force</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>clamp force</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>locking force</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>mould clamping force</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>mold clamping force</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>tonnage</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>machine tonnage</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>型締力</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>型締め力</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>型開力</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「型開力」（日本語）、「开模力」（中国語）、「형개력」（韓国語）、「Öffnungskraft」（ドイツ語）、「fuerza de apertura」（スペイン語）は金型を開くときに可動盤を引き離す力で、金型を閉じて保持する型締力とは別の量。「Spannkraft」（ドイツ語）は治具やチャックで工作物を締め付ける力を指し、成形機の型締力には「Schließkraft」を使う。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>锁模力</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>合模力</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>开模力</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「型開力」（日本語）、「开模力」（中国語）、「형개력」（韓国語）、「Öffnungskraft」（ドイツ語）、「fuerza de apertura」（スペイン語）は金型を開くときに可動盤を引き離す力で、金型を閉じて保持する型締力とは別の量。「Spannkraft」（ドイツ語）は治具やチャックで工作物を締め付ける力を指し、成形機の型締力には「Schließkraft」を使う。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>형체력</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>형체결력</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>형개력</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「型開力」（日本語）、「开模力」（中国語）、「형개력」（韓国語）、「Öffnungskraft」（ドイツ語）、「fuerza de apertura」（スペイン語）は金型を開くときに可動盤を引き離す力で、金型を閉じて保持する型締力とは別の量。「Spannkraft」（ドイツ語）は治具やチャックで工作物を締め付ける力を指し、成形機の型締力には「Schließkraft」を使う。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Schließkraft</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Zuhaltekraft</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Öffnungskraft</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「型開力」（日本語）、「开模力」（中国語）、「형개력」（韓国語）、「Öffnungskraft」（ドイツ語）、「fuerza de apertura」（スペイン語）は金型を開くときに可動盤を引き離す力で、金型を閉じて保持する型締力とは別の量。「Spannkraft」（ドイツ語）は治具やチャックで工作物を締め付ける力を指し、成形機の型締力には「Schließkraft」を使う。</note></termSec><termSec><term>Spannkraft</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「型開力」（日本語）、「开模力」（中国語）、「형개력」（韓国語）、「Öffnungskraft」（ドイツ語）、「fuerza de apertura」（スペイン語）は金型を開くときに可動盤を引き離す力で、金型を閉じて保持する型締力とは別の量。「Spannkraft」（ドイツ語）は治具やチャックで工作物を締め付ける力を指し、成形機の型締力には「Schließkraft」を使う。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>fuerza de cierre</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>fuerza de apertura</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「型開力」（日本語）、「开模力」（中国語）、「형개력」（韓国語）、「Öffnungskraft」（ドイツ語）、「fuerza de apertura」（スペイン語）は金型を開くときに可動盤を引き離す力で、金型を閉じて保持する型締力とは別の量。「Spannkraft」（ドイツ語）は治具やチャックで工作物を締め付ける力を指し、成形機の型締力には「Schließkraft」を使う。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-00964"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / clamping-unit</descrip><descrip type="definition">Hydraulic valve that opens, closes or switches oil flow paths, for example a 4/3-way solenoid valve, to drive the clamp, injection or ejector cylinders forward and back.</descrip><admin type="source">ISO 1219-1 Fluid power systems and components — Graphical symbols and circuit diagrams — Part 1</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>directional control valve</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>directional valve</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>way valve</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>方向制御弁</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>方向切換弁</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>方向控制阀</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>换向阀</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>방향 제어 밸브</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>방향 전환 밸브</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Wegeventil</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>válvula distribuidora</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>válvula direccional</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-01050"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / clamping-unit</descrip><descrip type="definition">Half of the mold mounted on the fixed platen at the nozzle side, which usually contains the sprue bushing and does not move during the cycle.</descrip><admin type="source">F. Johannaber, Injection Molding Machines: A User's Guide, 4th ed., Hanser (2008); Menges G., Michaeli W., Mohren P., How to Make Injection Molds, 3rd ed., Hanser (2001)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>fixed mold half</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>fixed mould half</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>stationary half</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>injection half</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>cover half</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>stationary mold half</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>stationary mould half</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>A-half</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>固定側金型</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>固定型</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>固定側</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>固定盤</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>日本語「固定盤」は成形機側の固定プラテンを指す別概念で、金型の固定側半分ではない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>定模</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>定模侧</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>고정측 금형</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>고정측</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>고정형</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>düsenseitige Werkzeughälfte</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>feste Werkzeughälfte</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>feststehende Werkzeughälfte</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>parte fija del molde</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>mitad fija del molde</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>lado fijo del molde</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-01162"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / molding-process</descrip><descrip type="definition">Operating mode in which each machine movement, such as mold closing, injection, screw rotation or ejection, runs only when the operator presses the corresponding key; used for setup and troubleshooting.</descrip><admin type="source">Johannaber, Injection Molding Machines: A User's Guide, 4th ed. (Hanser, 2008); F. Johannaber, Injection Molding Machines: A User's Guide, 4th ed., Hanser (2008)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>manual operation</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>manual mode</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>manual operation mode</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>手動運転</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>手動操作</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>手動モード</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>手动操作</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>手动运行</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>手动模式</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>수동 운전</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>수동 조작</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>수동 모드</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>manueller Betrieb</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Handbetrieb</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>operación manual</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>funcionamiento manual</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>modo manual</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-01234"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / automation-peripherals</descrip><descrip type="definition">Taking the molded parts out of the open mold after ejection, either by hand, by letting them fall freely or with a take-out robot.</descrip><admin type="source">Johannaber, Injection Molding Machines: A User's Guide, 4th ed. (Hanser)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>part removal</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>part take-out</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>part removal from the mold</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>part removal from the mould</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>成形品取出し</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>製品取出し</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>成形品の取り出し</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>部品除去</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「部品除去」（日本語）・「零件去除」（中国語）は removal を「除去・去除」と訳した直訳で、不要部分を取り除く意味に読まれる。成形品を型から取り出す動作には使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>制品取出</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>取件</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>取出制品</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>零件去除</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「部品除去」（日本語）・「零件去除」（中国語）は removal を「除去・去除」と訳した直訳で、不要部分を取り除く意味に読まれる。成形品を型から取り出す動作には使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>성형품 취출</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>제품 취출</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Teileentnahme</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Formteilentnahme</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Entnahme der Formteile</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>extracción de piezas</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>extracción de piezas moldeadas</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-01241"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / molding-process</descrip><descrip type="definition">Thin outer layer of an injection-molded part that solidifies first against the cold mold wall and retains high molecular or fiber orientation from the fountain flow.</descrip><admin type="source">Osswald, Turng, Gramann (eds.), Injection Molding Handbook, 2nd ed. (Hanser, 2008)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>skin layer</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>skin</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>surface layer</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>スキン層</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>皮膚層</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「皮膚層」（日本語）・「皮肤层」（中国語）・「피부층」（韓国語）は skin（皮膚）の直訳で、成形品の表層の意味では使われない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>皮层</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>皮肤层</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「皮膚層」（日本語）・「皮肤层」（中国語）・「피부층」（韓国語）は skin（皮膚）の直訳で、成形品の表層の意味では使われない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>스킨층</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>피부층</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「皮膚層」（日本語）・「皮肤层」（中国語）・「피부층」（韓国語）は skin（皮膚）の直訳で、成形品の表層の意味では使われない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Randschicht</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>capa de piel</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-01264"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / molding-defects</descrip><descrip type="definition">Molding defect in which the melt does not completely fill the cavity, leaving the part with missing sections, typically at the end of flow or in thin areas.</descrip><admin type="source">Goodship, Troubleshooting Injection Moulding, Rapra Review Report (Rapra Technology, 2004)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>short shot</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>short</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>short molding</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>incomplete filling</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>ショートショット</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>充填不足</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>充てん不足</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>未充填</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ショート</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>短いショット</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「短いショット」（日本語）・「짧은 샷」（韓国語）・「kurzer Schuss」（ドイツ語）は short shot の直訳で、キャビティが充填されきらない成形不良を表さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>短射</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>缺料</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>欠注</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>미성형</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>쇼트 샷</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>미충전</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>짧은 샷</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「短いショット」（日本語）・「짧은 샷」（韓国語）・「kurzer Schuss」（ドイツ語）は short shot の直訳で、キャビティが充填されきらない成形不良を表さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>unvollständige Füllung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Short Shot</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Füllmangel</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>kurzer Schuss</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「短いショット」（日本語）・「짧은 샷」（韓国語）・「kurzer Schuss」（ドイツ語）は short shot の直訳で、キャビティが充填されきらない成形不良を表さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>inyección incompleta</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>pieza incompleta</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>tiro corto</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-01271"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / molding-defects</descrip><descrip type="definition">Line or notch on a molded part where two melt fronts meet and fuse, for example behind a hole or between two gates; it is often visible and mechanically weaker.</descrip><admin type="source">ISO 472 Plastics — Vocabulary; JIS K 6900 プラスチック—用語; Rosato, Rosato, Rosato, Injection Molding Handbook, 3rd ed. (Kluwer Academic, 2000)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>weld line</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>weld mark</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>knit line</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>ウェルドライン</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ウエルドライン</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ニットライン</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>溶接線</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「溶接線」(JA)・「焊缝」(ZH)は金属などの溶接継手の意で、成形品で流動先端が合流してできる線を指さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>熔接线</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>熔接痕</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>熔合线</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>焊缝</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「溶接線」(JA)・「焊缝」(ZH)は金属などの溶接継手の意で、成形品で流動先端が合流してできる線を指さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>웰드 라인</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Bindenaht</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>línea de soldadura</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-01309"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / molding-defects</descrip><descrip type="definition">Warpage in which a molded part rotates about its own long axis so that its ends no longer lie in the same plane.</descrip><admin type="source">Fischer, Handbook of Molded Part Shrinkage and Warpage, 2nd ed. (Elsevier, 2013)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>twist</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>torsional warpage</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>twisting</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>ねじれ</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ねじれ変形</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>扭曲变形</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>扭曲</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>비틀림 변형</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>비틀림</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Torsionsverzug</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Verwindung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>alabeo torsional</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>torsión</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-01464"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / quality-testing</descrip><descrip type="definition">Approved part kept as the reference against which production parts are compared for appearance, color or dimensions.</descrip><admin type="source">AIAG Production Part Approval Process (PPAP) reference manual</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>master sample</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>golden sample</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>reference sample</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>標準見本</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>マスターサンプル</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>限度見本</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「限度見本」、中国語「限度样品」、韓国語「한도 견본」、ドイツ語「Grenzmuster」、スペイン語「muestra límite」は合否の境界（許容限度）を示す見本で、基準となる良品見本（マスターサンプル）とは別。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>标准样件</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>封样</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>限度样品</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「限度見本」、中国語「限度样品」、韓国語「한도 견본」、ドイツ語「Grenzmuster」、スペイン語「muestra límite」は合否の境界（許容限度）を示す見本で、基準となる良品見本（マスターサンプル）とは別。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>마스터 샘플</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>한도 견본</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「限度見本」、中国語「限度样品」、韓国語「한도 견본」、ドイツ語「Grenzmuster」、スペイン語「muestra límite」は合否の境界（許容限度）を示す見本で、基準となる良品見本（マスターサンプル）とは別。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Referenzmuster</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Grenzmuster</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「限度見本」、中国語「限度样品」、韓国語「한도 견본」、ドイツ語「Grenzmuster」、スペイン語「muestra límite」は合否の境界（許容限度）を示す見本で、基準となる良品見本（マスターサンプル）とは別。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>muestra patrón</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>muestra maestra</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>muestra límite</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「限度見本」、中国語「限度样品」、韓国語「한도 견본」、ドイツ語「Grenzmuster」、スペイン語「muestra límite」は合否の境界（許容限度）を示す見本で、基準となる良品見本（マスターサンプル）とは別。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-01498"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / mold-structure</descrip><descrip type="definition">Tool, usually of steel, that contains one or more cavities together with feed, temperature-control and ejection systems, in which the material is shaped and solidified.</descrip><admin type="source">ISO 472 (Plastics — Vocabulary); JIS K 6900 プラスチック—用語; Pye R.G.W., Injection Mould Design, 4th ed., Longman (1989)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>mold</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>mould</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>tool</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>mould tool</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>mold tool</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>金型</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>モールド</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>カビ</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「カビ」（日本語）、「霉菌」（中国語）、「곰팡이」（韓国語）、「Schimmel」（ドイツ語）、「moho」（スペイン語）は菌類のかびの意で、成形用の型ではない（mould の機械翻訳で起こる誤り）。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>模具</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>霉菌</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「カビ」（日本語）、「霉菌」（中国語）、「곰팡이」（韓国語）、「Schimmel」（ドイツ語）、「moho」（スペイン語）は菌類のかびの意で、成形用の型ではない（mould の機械翻訳で起こる誤り）。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>금형</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>곰팡이</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「カビ」（日本語）、「霉菌」（中国語）、「곰팡이」（韓国語）、「Schimmel」（ドイツ語）、「moho」（スペイン語）は菌類のかびの意で、成形用の型ではない（mould の機械翻訳で起こる誤り）。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Formwerkzeug</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Werkzeug</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Form</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Schimmel</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「カビ」（日本語）、「霉菌」（中国語）、「곰팡이」（韓国語）、「Schimmel」（ドイツ語）、「moho」（スペイン語）は菌類のかびの意で、成形用の型ではない（mould の機械翻訳で起こる誤り）。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>molde</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>herramental</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>moho</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「カビ」（日本語）、「霉菌」（中国語）、「곰팡이」（韓国語）、「Schimmel」（ドイツ語）、「moho」（スペイン語）は菌類のかびの意で、成形用の型ではない（mould の機械翻訳で起こる誤り）。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-01510"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / mold-structure</descrip><descrip type="definition">Mold whose runner system is kept molten, usually by a hot runner, so that no solidified runner is ejected with the parts.</descrip><admin type="source">Rees H., Mold Engineering, 2nd ed., Hanser (2002)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>runnerless mold</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>runnerless mould</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>runnerless tool</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>ランナーレス金型</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>无流道模具</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>러너리스 금형</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>angussloses Werkzeug</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>molde sin colada</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>molde sin canales</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-01651"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / mold-structure</descrip><descrip type="definition">Triangular rib that joins a wall, boss or flange to an adjacent surface to stiffen it without adding much wall thickness.</descrip><admin type="source">Malloy R.A., Plastic Part Design for Injection Molding, Hanser (1994)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>gusset</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>gusset rib</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>support rib</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>ガセット</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>三角リブ</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>マチ</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>日本語「マチ」は袋や衣服に幅を持たせるための布（gusset）の意味で、成形品の三角リブには使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>三角加强筋</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>角撑</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>삼각 리브</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>거싯</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Stützrippe</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Dreiecksrippe</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>cartela</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>nervio triangular</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-01742"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / runner-gating</descrip><descrip type="definition">Edge gate that widens like a fan from the runner towards the part, usually with decreasing depth, so that the melt enters along a wide front with less jetting, orientation and warpage in flat parts.</descrip><admin type="source">Beaumont J.P., Runner and Gating Design Handbook, 2nd ed., Hanser (2007)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>fan gate</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>ファンゲート</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>扇形ゲート</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>扇形浇口</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>风扇浇口</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「风扇浇口」（中国語）は fan を送風機の「风扇」と訳した誤訳で、扇形に広がるゲートを表さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>팬 게이트</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>부채꼴 게이트</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Fächeranguss</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Fächeranschnitt</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>entrada en abanico</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>compuerta de abanico</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-01745"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / runner-gating</descrip><descrip type="definition">Gate fed from a ring-shaped runner surrounding a core, entering the cavity around its full circumference; used for tubular parts to avoid weld lines.</descrip><admin type="source">Beaumont J.P., Runner and Gating Design Handbook, 2nd ed., Hanser (2007); JIS K 6900 プラスチック—用語</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>ring gate</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>リングゲート</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>环形浇口</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>링 게이트</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Ringanschnitt</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>entrada anular</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-01759"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / runner-gating</descrip><descrip type="definition">Cross-sectional dimensions of a gate (diameter, or width and depth) together with its land length, which control shear, pressure drop, freeze-off time and gate vestige.</descrip><admin type="source">Beaumont J.P., Runner and Gating Design Handbook, 2nd ed., Hanser (2007)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>gate size</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>gate dimensions</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>ゲートサイズ</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ゲート寸法</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>浇口尺寸</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>门尺寸</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>中国語「门尺寸」、ドイツ語「Torgröße」、スペイン語「tamaño de la puerta」は gate を出入口の門・扉と訳した誤りで、金型のゲートを表さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>게이트 크기</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>게이트 치수</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Anschnittgröße</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Anschnittabmessungen</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Torgröße</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>中国語「门尺寸」、ドイツ語「Torgröße」、スペイン語「tamaño de la puerta」は gate を出入口の門・扉と訳した誤りで、金型のゲートを表さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>tamaño de la entrada</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>tamaño de la compuerta</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>tamaño de la puerta</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>中国語「门尺寸」、ドイツ語「Torgröße」、スペイン語「tamaño de la puerta」は gate を出入口の門・扉と訳した誤りで、金型のゲートを表さない。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-01875"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / mold-thermal-venting</descrip><descrip type="definition">Liquid, normally water or oil, pumped through the cooling channels of a mold to remove heat from the molded part.</descrip><admin type="source">Kazmer, Injection Mold Design Engineering (Hanser, textbook); Menges, Michaeli &amp; Mohren, How to Make Injection Molds (Hanser, textbook)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>coolant</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>cooling medium</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>冷却媒体</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>冷却介质</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>冷却液</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>切削液</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>中国語「切削液」、韓国語「절삭유」は工作機械の切削油剤を指し、金型内を流れる冷却媒体には使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>냉각 매체</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>냉각제</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>절삭유</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>中国語「切削液」、韓国語「절삭유」は工作機械の切削油剤を指し、金型内を流れる冷却媒体には使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Kühlmedium</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Kühlmittel</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>medio refrigerante</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>refrigerante</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-02015"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / mold-thermal-venting</descrip><descrip type="definition">Letting air and volatile gases escape from the cavity as the melt fills it, through shallow vent grooves, parting-line vents, porous inserts or ejector clearances, to prevent burn marks and short shots.</descrip><admin type="source">Menges, Michaeli &amp; Mohren, How to Make Injection Molds (Hanser, textbook)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>venting</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>mold venting</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>gas venting</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>ガス抜き</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ベント</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>換気</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>日本語「換気」、中国語「通风」、韓国語「환기」、ドイツ語「Lüftung」は室内の空気の入れ替えを指し、金型キャビティからのガス抜きには使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>模具排气</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>排气</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>通风</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>日本語「換気」、中国語「通风」、韓国語「환기」、ドイツ語「Lüftung」は室内の空気の入れ替えを指し、金型キャビティからのガス抜きには使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>벤팅</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>가스 빼기</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>환기</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>日本語「換気」、中国語「通风」、韓国語「환기」、ドイツ語「Lüftung」は室内の空気の入れ替えを指し、金型キャビティからのガス抜きには使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Werkzeugentlüftung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Entlüftung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Lüftung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>日本語「換気」、中国語「通风」、韓国語「환기」、ドイツ語「Lüftung」は室内の空気の入れ替えを指し、金型キャビティからのガス抜きには使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>venteo</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>evacuación de gases</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-02060"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / mold-thermal-venting</descrip><descrip type="definition">Temperature of the molded part, at its surface or averaged through the wall, during cooling in the mold and after ejection; simulation uses it to judge whether the part can be ejected.</descrip><admin type="source">Autodesk Moldflow public help documentation (cool analysis)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>part temperature</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>molded part temperature</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>成形品温度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>制品温度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>塑件温度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>성형품 온도</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Formteiltemperatur</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>temperatura de la pieza</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-02183"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / mold-making</descrip><descrip type="definition">Cold working of a metal surface by bombarding it with small steel or ceramic balls, used on mold and machine parts to induce compressive residual stress and improve fatigue and crack resistance.</descrip><admin type="source">ISO 2080 Metallic and other inorganic coatings — Surface treatment, metallic and other inorganic coatings — Vocabulary</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>shot peening</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>peening</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>ショットピーニング</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ショットブラスト</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「ショットブラスト」（日本語）、「쇼트 블라스트」（韓国語）は投射材を当てて表面の清浄化や粗面化を行う別の処理（shot blasting）で、圧縮残留応力を与えて疲労強度を高めるショットピーニングとは目的が異なる。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>喷丸强化</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>喷丸</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>쇼트 피닝</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>숏 피닝</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>쇼트 블라스트</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「ショットブラスト」（日本語）、「쇼트 블라스트」（韓国語）は投射材を当てて表面の清浄化や粗面化を行う別の処理（shot blasting）で、圧縮残留応力を与えて疲労強度を高めるショットピーニングとは目的が異なる。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Kugelstrahlen</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Verfestigungsstrahlen</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>granallado de pretensado</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>shot peening</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-02265"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / mold-making</descrip><descrip type="definition">Maintenance in which a mold or machine is repaired only after a failure has occurred, as opposed to preventive or predictive maintenance.</descrip><admin type="source">Rees &amp; Catoen, Selecting Injection Molds (Hanser, textbook)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>breakdown maintenance</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>corrective maintenance</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>run-to-failure maintenance</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>事後保全</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>事后维修</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>修复性维修</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>故障维修</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>사후 보전</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>고장 정비</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>korrektive Instandhaltung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ausfallbedingte Instandhaltung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>mantenimiento correctivo</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>mantenimiento por avería</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-02278"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / mold-making</descrip><descrip type="definition">Sudden locking of sliding or rotating mold parts, such as slides, ejector pins or cores, when their surfaces weld together because of insufficient clearance, lubrication or hardness.</descrip><admin type="source">Rees &amp; Catoen, Selecting Injection Molds (Hanser, textbook)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>seizure</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>seizing</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>焼き付き</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>焼付き</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>差押え</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「差押え」（日本語）、「扣押」（中国語）、「압류」（韓国語）、「Beschlagnahme」（ドイツ語）、「embargo」（スペイン語）は法律上の差押え（seizure）の訳で、摺動部品の焼付きの意味はない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>咬死</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>扣押</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「差押え」（日本語）、「扣押」（中国語）、「압류」（韓国語）、「Beschlagnahme」（ドイツ語）、「embargo」（スペイン語）は法律上の差押え（seizure）の訳で、摺動部品の焼付きの意味はない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>소착</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>눌어붙음</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>압류</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「差押え」（日本語）、「扣押」（中国語）、「압류」（韓国語）、「Beschlagnahme」（ドイツ語）、「embargo」（スペイン語）は法律上の差押え（seizure）の訳で、摺動部品の焼付きの意味はない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Festfressen</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Beschlagnahme</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「差押え」（日本語）、「扣押」（中国語）、「압류」（韓国語）、「Beschlagnahme」（ドイツ語）、「embargo」（スペイン語）は法律上の差押え（seizure）の訳で、摺動部品の焼付きの意味はない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>agarrotamiento</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>embargo</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「差押え」（日本語）、「扣押」（中国語）、「압류」（韓国語）、「Beschlagnahme」（ドイツ語）、「embargo」（スペイン語）は法律上の差押え（seizure）の訳で、摺動部品の焼付きの意味はない。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-02291"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / mold-making</descrip><descrip type="definition">Collective term for the molds and associated fixtures, gauges and end-of-arm tools needed to produce a given part, as budgeted and owned in a project.</descrip><admin type="source">Rees &amp; Catoen, Selecting Injection Molds (Hanser, textbook)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>tooling</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>tools and fixtures</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>production tooling</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>金型・治具</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>工装模具</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>模具工装</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>工具</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「工具」（中国語）は手工具や刃物などの道具を指し、製品の生産に必要な金型・治具一式（工装模具）を指さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>툴링</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>금형 및 지그</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Werkzeuge und Vorrichtungen</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>utillaje</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-02336"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / special-molding</descrip><descrip type="definition">Enclosing a component such as a coil, sensor or electronic assembly completely in plastic by molding around it, to seal and protect it.</descrip><admin type="source">Osswald, Turng &amp; Gramann (eds.), Injection Molding Handbook (Hanser)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>encapsulation</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>encapsulation molding</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>カプセル封入</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>封止成形</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ポッティング</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「ポッティング」（日本語）、「灌封」（中国語）、「포팅」（韓国語）は液状樹脂をケースなどに流し込んで硬化させる注型の工程（potting）を指し、成形による封入とは別の工程。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>包封</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>包封成型</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>灌封</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「ポッティング」（日本語）、「灌封」（中国語）、「포팅」（韓国語）は液状樹脂をケースなどに流し込んで硬化させる注型の工程（potting）を指し、成形による封入とは別の工程。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>봉지 성형</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>캡슐화</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>포팅</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「ポッティング」（日本語）、「灌封」（中国語）、「포팅」（韓国語）は液状樹脂をケースなどに流し込んで硬化させる注型の工程（potting）を指し、成形による封入とは別の工程。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Verkapselung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Verkapseln</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>encapsulado</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>encapsulación</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-02370"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / special-molding</descrip><descrip type="definition">Unit that separates nitrogen from compressed air by membrane or pressure-swing adsorption to supply gas for gas-assist injection or physical foaming.</descrip><admin type="source">Osswald, Turng &amp; Gramann (eds.), Injection Molding Handbook (Hanser)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>nitrogen generator</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>N2 generator</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>窒素ガス発生装置</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>窒素発生装置</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>制氮机</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>氮气发生器</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>질소 발생기</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Stickstoffgenerator</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>generador de nitrógeno</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-02469"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / special-molding</descrip><descrip type="definition">Step in metal or ceramic injection molding that removes most of the binder from the molded green part by solvent, catalytic or thermal treatment before sintering.</descrip><admin type="source">German &amp; Bose, Injection Molding of Metals and Ceramics (MPIF)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>debinding</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>binder removal</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>脱脂</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>脱バインダー</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>脱脂</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>脱粘</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>탈지</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>탈바인더</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Entbindern</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Entbinderung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Entfettung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>ドイツ語「Entfettung」・スペイン語「desengrase」は日本語・中国語の「脱脂」を油分を除く脱脂（degreasing）と取り違えた訳で、成形体からバインダーを除く工程には「Entbindern」「eliminación del ligante」を使う。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>eliminación del ligante</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>desaglomerado</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>desengrase</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>ドイツ語「Entfettung」・スペイン語「desengrase」は日本語・中国語の「脱脂」を油分を除く脱脂（degreasing）と取り違えた訳で、成形体からバインダーを除く工程には「Entbindern」「eliminación del ligante」を使う。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-02566"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / other-processes</descrip><descrip type="definition">Machine with two horizontal counter-rotating rolls, often at different speeds and temperatures, on which polymer compounds are masticated, mixed or sheeted in the open nip; a serious entrapment hazard.</descrip><admin type="source">EN 1417 Plastics and rubber machines — Two roll mills — Safety requirements</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>two-roll mill</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>two roll mill</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>open mill</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>mixing mill</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>2本ロール機</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ミキシングロール</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>オープンロール</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>开炼机</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>双辊开炼机</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>双辊轧机</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>中国語「双辊轧机」は金属を圧延する二重圧延機を指し、ゴムや樹脂を混練する2本ロール機（开炼机）ではない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>2롤 밀</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>오픈 롤</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Mischwalzwerk</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Walzwerk</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Zweiwalzenwalzwerk</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>molino de dos rodillos</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>mezclador de rodillos abierto</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>mezcladora de cilindros</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-02587"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / other-processes</descrip><descrip type="definition">Unit downstream of the extruder and cooling section, usually with belts or caterpillar tracks or rolls, that pulls the extrudate at a controlled constant speed and so sets its final dimensions.</descrip><admin type="source">EN 1114-3 Plastics and rubber machines — Extruders and extrusion lines — Part 3: Safety requirements for haul-offs</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>haul-off</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>puller</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>haul-off unit</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>take-off unit</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>引取機</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>引取り機</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>引取装置</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>牵引机</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>牵引装置</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>인취기</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>인취 장치</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Abzug</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Abzugsvorrichtung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>extractor</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>unidad de arrastre</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-02788"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / other-processes</descrip><descrip type="definition">Machine with several heated, precisely gapped rolls through which a plasticized compound is passed to form film or sheet of controlled thickness.</descrip><admin type="source">EN 12301 Plastics and rubber machines — Calenders — Safety requirements</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>calender</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>calender line</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>カレンダ</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>カレンダー</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>压延机</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>日历</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「日历」（中国語）・「달력」（韓国語）・「Kalender」（ドイツ語）・「calendario」（スペイン語）は暦（カレンダー）の意の誤訳で、ロールでシートを成形する機械には使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>캘린더</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>달력</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「日历」（中国語）・「달력」（韓国語）・「Kalender」（ドイツ語）・「calendario」（スペイン語）は暦（カレンダー）の意の誤訳で、ロールでシートを成形する機械には使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Kalander</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Kalender</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「日历」（中国語）・「달력」（韓国語）・「Kalender」（ドイツ語）・「calendario」（スペイン語）は暦（カレンダー）の意の誤訳で、ロールでシートを成形する機械には使わない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>calandra</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>calendario</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「日历」（中国語）・「달력」（韓国語）・「Kalender」（ドイツ語）・「calendario」（スペイン語）は暦（カレンダー）の意の誤訳で、ロールでシートを成形する機械には使わない。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-02875"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / secondary-operations</descrip><descrip type="definition">Load-bearing capacity of a welded joint between thermoplastic parts, determined for example by tensile pull-off, burst or peel testing and often compared with the strength of the base material.</descrip><admin type="source">Troughton, Handbook of Plastics Joining: A Practical Guide, 2nd ed. (William Andrew/PDL)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>weld strength</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>joint strength</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>溶着強度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>溶接強度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>ウェルド強度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「ウェルド強度」（日本語）・「熔接痕强度」（中国語）・「웰드라인 강도」（韓国語）・「Bindenahtfestigkeit」（ドイツ語）・「resistencia de la línea de soldadura」（スペイン語）は射出成形品のウェルドライン部の強度を指し、部品同士を溶着した接合部の強度とは別の概念。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>焊接强度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>熔接强度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>熔接痕强度</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「ウェルド強度」（日本語）・「熔接痕强度」（中国語）・「웰드라인 강도」（韓国語）・「Bindenahtfestigkeit」（ドイツ語）・「resistencia de la línea de soldadura」（スペイン語）は射出成形品のウェルドライン部の強度を指し、部品同士を溶着した接合部の強度とは別の概念。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>용착 강도</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>용접 강도</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>웰드라인 강도</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「ウェルド強度」（日本語）・「熔接痕强度」（中国語）・「웰드라인 강도」（韓国語）・「Bindenahtfestigkeit」（ドイツ語）・「resistencia de la línea de soldadura」（スペイン語）は射出成形品のウェルドライン部の強度を指し、部品同士を溶着した接合部の強度とは別の概念。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Schweißnahtfestigkeit</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Bindenahtfestigkeit</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「ウェルド強度」（日本語）・「熔接痕强度」（中国語）・「웰드라인 강도」（韓国語）・「Bindenahtfestigkeit」（ドイツ語）・「resistencia de la línea de soldadura」（スペイン語）は射出成形品のウェルドライン部の強度を指し、部品同士を溶着した接合部の強度とは別の概念。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>resistencia de la soldadura</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>resistencia de la unión soldada</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>resistencia de la línea de soldadura</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「ウェルド強度」（日本語）・「熔接痕强度」（中国語）・「웰드라인 강도」（韓国語）・「Bindenahtfestigkeit」（ドイツ語）・「resistencia de la línea de soldadura」（スペイン語）は射出成形品のウェルドライン部の強度を指し、部品同士を溶着した接合部の強度とは別の概念。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-02893"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / secondary-operations</descrip><descrip type="definition">Manual or semi-automatic welding of thermoplastic sheet, film and pipe in which a stream of hot air or nitrogen softens the joint surfaces, usually with a filler rod of the same plastic pressed in; lap welding of films and membranes needs no rod.</descrip><admin type="source">Grewell, Benatar, Park (eds.), Plastics and Composites Welding Handbook (Hanser); JIS K 6900 プラスチック—用語</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>hot gas welding</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>hot-gas welding</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>hot air welding</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>hot-air welding</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>熱風溶接</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>热风焊接</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>热气焊接</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>열풍 용접</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Warmgasschweißen</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Heißluftschweißen</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>soldadura por gas caliente</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>soldadura por aire caliente</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-02943"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / secondary-operations</descrip><descrip type="definition">Surface treatment in which an oxidizing gas flame briefly sweeps a polyolefin part, raising its surface energy for painting, printing or bonding.</descrip><admin type="source">Vetaphone: corona and plasma surface treatment (public technical pages)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>flame treatment</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>flaming</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>flame pretreatment</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>フレーム処理</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>火炎処理</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>難燃処理</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「難燃処理」（日本語）・「阻燃处理」（中国語）・「난연 처리」（韓国語）・「tratamiento ignífugo」（スペイン語）は燃えにくくする処理で、炎で表面を酸化して濡れ性を上げる前処理とは別の概念。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>火焰处理</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>阻燃处理</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「難燃処理」（日本語）・「阻燃处理」（中国語）・「난연 처리」（韓国語）・「tratamiento ignífugo」（スペイン語）は燃えにくくする処理で、炎で表面を酸化して濡れ性を上げる前処理とは別の概念。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>화염 처리</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>플레임 처리</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>난연 처리</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「難燃処理」（日本語）・「阻燃处理」（中国語）・「난연 처리」（韓国語）・「tratamiento ignífugo」（スペイン語）は燃えにくくする処理で、炎で表面を酸化して濡れ性を上げる前処理とは別の概念。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Beflammung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Flammbehandlung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>flameado</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>tratamiento a la llama</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>tratamiento ignífugo</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「難燃処理」（日本語）・「阻燃处理」（中国語）・「난연 처리」（韓国語）・「tratamiento ignífugo」（スペイン語）は燃えにくくする処理で、炎で表面を酸化して濡れ性を上げる前処理とは別の概念。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-03074"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / automation-peripherals</descrip><descrip type="definition">In SMED, changeover work that can only be done while the molding machine is stopped, such as unclamping and removing the old mold and clamping the new one.</descrip><admin type="source">Shingo, A Revolution in Manufacturing: The SMED System (Productivity Press)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>internal setup</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>internal changeover</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>inside exchange of die</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>IED</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>内段取り</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>内段取</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>内部設定</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「内部設定」（日本語）・「内部设置」（中国語）・「내부 설정」（韓国語）・「configuración interna」（スペイン語）は setup を「設定」と取った直訳で、機器の内部の設定（構成）と読まれ、機械を止めて行う段取り作業を表さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>内部作业</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>内部换模作业</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>内部设置</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「内部設定」（日本語）・「内部设置」（中国語）・「내부 설정」（韓国語）・「configuración interna」（スペイン語）は setup を「設定」と取った直訳で、機器の内部の設定（構成）と読まれ、機械を止めて行う段取り作業を表さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>내부 준비 작업</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>내부 설정</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「内部設定」（日本語）・「内部设置」（中国語）・「내부 설정」（韓国語）・「configuración interna」（スペイン語）は setup を「設定」と取った直訳で、機器の内部の設定（構成）と読まれ、機械を止めて行う段取り作業を表さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>internes Rüsten</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>preparación interna</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>configuración interna</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「内部設定」（日本語）・「内部设置」（中国語）・「내부 설정」（韓国語）・「configuración interna」（スペイン語）は setup を「設定」と取った直訳で、機器の内部の設定（構成）と読まれ、機械を止めて行う段取り作業を表さない。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-03075"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / automation-peripherals</descrip><descrip type="definition">Changeover work done while the machine is still producing, such as preheating the next mold and preparing tools, as opposed to internal setup.</descrip><admin type="source">Shingo, A Revolution in Manufacturing: The SMED System (Productivity Press)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>external setup</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>external changeover</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>outside exchange of die</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>外段取り</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>外段取</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>外部設定</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「外部設定」（日本語）・「外部设置」（中国語）・「외부 설정」（韓国語）・「configuración externa」（スペイン語）は setup を「設定」と取った直訳で、外部の設定（構成）と読まれ、機械の稼働中に行う段取り作業を表さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>外部作业</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>外部换模作业</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>外部设置</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「外部設定」（日本語）・「外部设置」（中国語）・「외부 설정」（韓国語）・「configuración externa」（スペイン語）は setup を「設定」と取った直訳で、外部の設定（構成）と読まれ、機械の稼働中に行う段取り作業を表さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>외부 준비 작업</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>외준비</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>외부 설정</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「外部設定」（日本語）・「外部设置」（中国語）・「외부 설정」（韓国語）・「configuración externa」（スペイン語）は setup を「設定」と取った直訳で、外部の設定（構成）と読まれ、機械の稼働中に行う段取り作業を表さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>externes Rüsten</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Außenrüsten</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>preparación externa</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>operaciones externas</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>configuración externa</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「外部設定」（日本語）・「外部设置」（中国語）・「외부 설정」（韓国語）・「configuración externa」（スペイン語）は setup を「設定」と取った直訳で、外部の設定（構成）と読まれ、機械の稼働中に行う段取り作業を表さない。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-03126"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / automation-peripherals</descrip><descrip type="definition">Camera-based inspection system with lighting and image-processing software that checks parts automatically for presence, dimensions, defects or codes.</descrip><admin type="source">KEYENCE: machine vision systems and code readers (public technical pages)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>vision system</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>machine vision system</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>camera inspection system</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>ビジョンシステム</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>画像処理システム</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>视觉系统</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>机器视觉系统</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>비전 시스템</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>머신 비전 시스템</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Bildverarbeitungssystem</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Visionsystem</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>sistema de visión</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>sistema de visión artificial</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-03200"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / quality-testing</descrip><descrip type="definition">Theoretically exact reference, established from a real feature of the part, to which geometrical tolerances of location or orientation are related; in molding it fixes how the part is held for measurement.</descrip><admin type="source">ISO 5459 Geometrical product specifications (GPS) — Geometrical tolerancing — Datums and datum systems</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>datum</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>データム</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>基准</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>数据</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「数据」（中国語）・「데이터」（韓国語）は data の訳で、幾何公差の基準ではない。ドイツ語の「Datum」は日付の意味。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>데이텀</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>데이터</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「数据」（中国語）・「데이터」（韓国語）は data の訳で、幾何公差の基準ではない。ドイツ語の「Datum」は日付の意味。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Bezug</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Datum</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「数据」（中国語）・「데이터」（韓国語）は data の訳で、幾何公差の基準ではない。ドイツ語の「Datum」は日付の意味。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>referencia</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-03245"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / quality-testing</descrip><descrip type="definition">Network of finite elements, such as triangles or tetrahedra, into which a part and mold model are divided for filling, cooling and warpage simulation; mesh type and density affect accuracy and run time.</descrip><admin type="source">Autodesk Moldflow Insight help: analysis types, mesh types and result descriptions (public documentation)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>mesh</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>finite element mesh</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>メッシュ</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>网格</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>有限元网格</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>메시</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>메쉬</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>FE-Netz</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Berechnungsnetz</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>malla de elementos finitos</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>malla</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-03409"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / plant-safety-sustainability</descrip><descrip type="definition">Plastic made wholly or partly from carbon of renewable biological origin, such as plant-derived monomers, irrespective of whether it is biodegradable.</descrip><admin type="source">EN 16575 Bio-based products — Vocabulary; Japan BioPlastics Association (JBPA): biomass plastic and biodegradable plastic identification systems (public)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>biobased plastic</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>bio-based plastic</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>biobased polymer</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>biomass plastic</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>バイオベースプラスチック</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>バイオマスプラスチック</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>生分解性プラスチック</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「生分解性プラスチック」（日本語）・「生物降解塑料」（中国語）・「생분해성 플라스틱」（韓国語）・「biologisch abbaubarer Kunststoff」（ドイツ語）・「plástico biodegradable」（スペイン語）は分解性による分類で、原料がバイオマス由来かどうかとは別。生分解しないバイオベースプラスチックもある。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>生物基塑料</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>生物质塑料</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>生物降解塑料</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「生分解性プラスチック」（日本語）・「生物降解塑料」（中国語）・「생분해성 플라스틱」（韓国語）・「biologisch abbaubarer Kunststoff」（ドイツ語）・「plástico biodegradable」（スペイン語）は分解性による分類で、原料がバイオマス由来かどうかとは別。生分解しないバイオベースプラスチックもある。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>바이오 기반 플라스틱</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>바이오베이스 플라스틱</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>바이오매스 플라스틱</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>생분해성 플라스틱</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「生分解性プラスチック」（日本語）・「生物降解塑料」（中国語）・「생분해성 플라스틱」（韓国語）・「biologisch abbaubarer Kunststoff」（ドイツ語）・「plástico biodegradable」（スペイン語）は分解性による分類で、原料がバイオマス由来かどうかとは別。生分解しないバイオベースプラスチックもある。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>biobasierter Kunststoff</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>biologisch abbaubarer Kunststoff</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「生分解性プラスチック」（日本語）・「生物降解塑料」（中国語）・「생분해성 플라스틱」（韓国語）・「biologisch abbaubarer Kunststoff」（ドイツ語）・「plástico biodegradable」（スペイン語）は分解性による分類で、原料がバイオマス由来かどうかとは別。生分解しないバイオベースプラスチックもある。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>plástico de base biológica</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>plástico biobasado</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>plástico de biomasa</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>plástico biodegradable</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「生分解性プラスチック」（日本語）・「生物降解塑料」（中国語）・「생분해성 플라스틱」（韓国語）・「biologisch abbaubarer Kunststoff」（ドイツ語）・「plástico biodegradable」（スペイン語）は分解性による分類で、原料がバイオマス由来かどうかとは別。生分解しないバイオベースプラスチックもある。</note></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-03431"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / plant-safety-sustainability</descrip><descrip type="definition">Waste with hazardous properties such as toxicity, flammability or ecotoxicity, for example used hydraulic oil, solvent residues or contaminated cleaning materials from a molding plant, which must be handled and disposed of under special rules.</descrip><admin type="source">Directive 2008/98/EC on waste (Waste Framework Directive)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>hazardous waste</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>有害廃棄物</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>危险废物</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>유해 폐기물</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>지정폐기물</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>gefährlicher Abfall</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>gefährliche Abfälle</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>residuo peligroso</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>residuos peligrosos</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
<conceptEntry id="PLAS-03433"><descrip type="subjectField">plas / plant-safety-sustainability</descrip><descrip type="definition">Keeping different waste streams in a plant (for example clean regrind, contaminated purgings, packaging, oil-soaked rags) apart at the point where they arise so that each can be recycled or disposed of properly.</descrip><admin type="source">Directive 2008/98/EC on waste (Waste Framework Directive)</admin><langSec xml:lang="en"><termSec><term>waste segregation</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>waste separation</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>source separation</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ja"><termSec><term>分別排出</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>分別</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>廃棄物の分別</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>隔離</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「隔離」（日本語）・「废物隔离」（中国語）は segregation の辞書訳で、隔離・封じ込めの意味に読まれ、廃棄物を種類別に分けることを表さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="zh"><termSec><term>废物分类</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>分类收集</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>垃圾分类</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>废物隔离</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">deprecatedTerm-admn-sts</termNote><note>「隔離」（日本語）・「废物隔离」（中国語）は segregation の辞書訳で、隔離・封じ込めの意味に読まれ、廃棄物を種類別に分けることを表さない。</note></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="ko"><termSec><term>분리배출</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>폐기물 분리배출</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="de"><termSec><term>Abfalltrennung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>Getrennthaltung</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec><langSec xml:lang="es"><termSec><term>separación de residuos</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">preferredTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>separación en origen</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec><termSec><term>segregación de residuos</term><termNote type="administrativeStatus">admittedTerm-admn-sts</termNote></termSec></langSec></conceptEntry>
</body></text>
